{"product_id":"uwell-popreel-n1-pod-system","title":"Uwell Popreel N1 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out Uwell Popreel N1 Pod System, featuring an integrated 520mAh rechargeable battery, 2mL pod capacity, and includes an integrated 1.2ohm coil. Constructed from durable PC materials, the chassis is lightweight and portable, fitting neatly into the hand, pocket, or purse. Equipped with an integrated 520mAh battery, rechargeable via bottom microUSB port. Outfitted with a 2mL refillable pod, the integrated coil measures in at 1.2ohm and delivers exceptional flavor and vapor production from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salt. Operating off a draw-activated firing mechanism, the Popreel N1 Pod System is simple to use and is a great addition to any collection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0573\/8709\/0059\/files\/Uwell_Popreel_Infographic.jpg?v=1656106882\" alt=\"uwell popreel n1 infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0573\/8709\/0059\/files\/Uwell_Popreel_Infographic.jpg?v=1656106882\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Popreel N1 Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 102.2mm by 22.1mm by 11.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage Output: 10W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePC Chassis Material\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Popreel N1 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Popreel N1 Pod Cartridge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531772174391,"sku":"U Popreel N1 Pod System","price":2450.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_popreel_n1_-_pod_system_-_matte_black.png?v=1741710159","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-popreel-n1-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




